WEBVTT

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:12.440
Un deux trois quatre! Un deux trois quatre!
One two three four! One two three four!

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.320
You guys did great today-kuma!

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.670
At this rate, we're definitely gonna get that legendary Paradise Coord,

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:23.080
then we just gotta make it glow and we'll have our miracle-kuma!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:23.820
Capisce!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.210
Better and better, babies!

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.670
With this kind of progress Falulu,

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.540
much less SoLaMi SMILE, will have no chance against you-usa!

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:34.460
Much less what-kuma?

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:39.230
I'll have you know these are super popular idols on the Verge of Breakthrough-kuma!

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:40.650
What of it-usa?

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:43.160
My babies all ranked up too!

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.780
When the heck?

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:49.980
We're just one step away from the major class... It's crazy.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.900
But Falulu isn't your everyday idol-pri.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:58.400
Exactly right. It's plainly obvious we'll lose if we don't come up with a plan.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.860
And what kind of plan do you have in mind?

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:03.320
Oh yeah!

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.030
What?

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:08.910
I was supposed to help out at home today!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.210
Sorry, gotta jet!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:16.810
Seriously, doesn't she have like, a hidden weakness?

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:19.630
She's too mysterious.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.260
Look, it's Lala!

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.560
Lala from SoLaMi SMILE!

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.840
Good luck on your next show!

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.520
Oh, thanks!

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:30.960
Can I get an autograph?

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:31.890
Me too!

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.980
Oh, Mai and Rika!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.410
Capisce!

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.400
And here's a complimentary illustration!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.160
It's a bit off, huh?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.320
Unbelievable!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.410
Amazing!

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.310
So fast!

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:47.470
She's superhuman!

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:48.970
Falulu power!

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.780
You're amazing, Falulu!

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:52.420
She can do anything perfectly!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.880
Line up next to each other, please.

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:56.660
What, like this?

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:57.800
What?

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:03.880
Amazing!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:04.680
Way too cool!

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:05.580
Super amazing!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:07.810
And they're accurate enough you'd think they're copied!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.270
Capisce.

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.230
This is so cute!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:13.000
It's a bit messy, but...

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.670
That's what makes it "Lala!"

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:16.480
Let's snap!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.300
Yeah, let's!

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.190
Yeah!

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:23.830
Falulu, wanna snap tickets?

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.630
Oh, sorry!

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.120
Falulu isn't that into Friend Tickets.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.650
What she'd <i>like</i> is your <i>likes</i> during the show!

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:36.830
So replace all the usual ticket stuff with tons of support for when she's on stage!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.290
Bye bye!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.800
Huh... Bye bye...

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:45.260
Unicorn, why can't Falulu snap tickets?

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:49.080
Wha? What are you on about?

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.750
You're the perfect idol, Falulu!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:55.680
You must be a distant presence far above the clouds!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.110
You can't go wrong with my advice.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.560
Now, I must go inspect the stage for your next performance.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:07.320
Be a good girl and go back to your room.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:07.930
Thanks, Lala!

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.500
Bye bye!
Thanks, Lala!

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.040
Make the next show a good one!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.880
Thanks, I will!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:14.940
Lala.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.620
Oh, Falulu.

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:21.830
Lala, tell me, are fans really that important?

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:27.110
Falulu is above the clouds, is Lala below the clouds?

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:30.050
But Falulu can see clouds above.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.220
Why is that? Tell me.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.310
Whuh?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.770
Slow down a bit.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:41.010
Falulu has been an idol from the moment she was born.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:45.990
Falulu did as Unicorn said, studied a lot,

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.780
performed a lot and made lots of fans.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:54.450
Falulu was born an idol, so that was natural.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.670
What was Lala when she was born?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.870
What? Uh... I was...

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:02.730
I was Lala when I was born!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:03.880
Just regular ol' Lala.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.220
Regular ol' Lala?

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.360
Yeah!

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:09.880
Why did you become an idol, Lala?

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:12.560
Huh? Well, that's...

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.850
Because I had fun doing it, I guess.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.310
Had fun?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:22.500
Yeah! Coming to PriPara and becoming an idol...

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:27.190
all started when I found Mireille's PriTicket File Bag.

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.350
Who dropped this?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.950
So many tickets!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:40.670
Prism Stone... This is where the entrance to PriPara is.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.760
So many cool clothes!

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.560
I'm not sure I can even go in...

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:49.440
Welcome to Prism Stone!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:54.890
Uh, I'm looking for whoever dropped this.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:07:01.900
Oh? Mireille entered PriPara from the gate here a while ago.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.090
I knew it.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.120
You came to bring this to her?

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.320
Thank you! The gate's right this way.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.360
Wait!

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.410
For you...

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.500
I'd recommend lovely style clothing.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.450
Twinkle Ribbon seems like a good match.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.120
I'll mark that as your stage outfit brand.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:26.340
Since you're here, I think you should try to get a performance under your belt.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.050
Whaaaaat?

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.520
Right this way.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.300
Me? Performing?

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:34.070
This is the gateway to PriPara.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:38.170
Just put your ticket in the scanner.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.870
Okay.

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:43.020
That will handle your registration to the world of PriPara.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:54.390
A fresh look that emphasizes your loveliness with its striped ribbons,

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:56.160
the Cutie Ribbon Coord.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.560
PriPara Change complete!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.850
Is this me?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.760
This is really me?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.630
I look totally different! Amazing!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.280
My clothes are so stylish! And my hair!

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:26.340
And I feel like I look way more mature!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.480
With the right makeup and clothes,

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:32.990
any girl can make a big transformation!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.370
So this is PriPara.

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:51.960
Wow! It's huge! And it's all part of PriPara!

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:55.210
Hey you, young lady over there? Howsabout a little performance?

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:57.990
Oh? You're too nervous to respond to someone so handsome?

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.540
Oh, how about you, lovely young lady?

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.690
Or you, char—

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.670
Mireille!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:06.270
Mireille, I have your bag!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.730
What's your deal-kuma!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.280
Huh? A plushie?

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:14.320
I'm no plushie! I work here! I'm a mascot! Mr. Kuma!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.960
You making fun of me-kuma?

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:16.940
How dare you!

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:23.560
Sorry! This is my first time in PriPara, so I don't really have any idea what's what or where I am.

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:25.060
What are you doing-pri?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:25.710
Kuma?

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:29.990
You're Mireille!

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:31.920
Yeah, that's me-pri.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.120
That's great.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.880
Here. Your PriTicket bag.

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.930
I found this lying on the street. Capisce!

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:44.880
Wow, there it is! I was in a pinch-pri! Thank you-pri!

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:49.190
You came all this way to bring it-pri? That's ultra nice of you-pri!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:53.190
Entry number 6, team name: Pretty App.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.630
Ready, go!

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.410
They're good.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:05.620
And I'm up after them? I said I'd do it, but how am I gonna...

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:10.710
I can't do this. Singing in front of all these people, no way!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:11.380
Lala!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.160
That loosen ya up-pri?

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:15.760
Whuh?

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.020
Everyone's waiting for us idols to sing!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:22.850
We've gotta sing with all we've got to reach the whole world!

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:27.560
This is the place where any girl can do that!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.720
Allowed to... sing with all you've got.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.960
Entry number 7: Lala and Mireille.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.350
Ready, go!

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:37.010
The stage's over here-pri!

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:53.660
<i>I can do this! I can do this!</i>

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.480
<i>So everyone can hear!</i>

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.290
Pri!

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:34.290
Making Drama! Switch On!

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:39.720
Twirl!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.050
Exciting

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.260
Present For You!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.780
Cyalume Change!

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:45.820
Pri!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.780
Making Drama! Switch On!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.800
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:09.260
Cyalume Change!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:15.940
Pri!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:34.480
Making Drama? Oh, is that that thing...

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.860
She taught me about Making Dramas.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:41.370
It's an element every bit as important as your singing, dancing, and outfit coordination.

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:45.150
What do you think and feel in your ordinary life?

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:48.080
What do you want to express through song?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.220
It means to convey something meaningful to others-pri!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:54.950
What you think and feel? What you want to express?

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.910
I am a sea lion...

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:00.300
Your... feelings...
I am a sea lion...

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:00.330
Come to think of it, that Making Drama of yours must have taken ages to make.
I am a sea lion...

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:04.900
Come to think of it, that Making Drama of yours must have taken ages to make.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:10.480
Frozen Castle Mirage!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:17.540
No, Unicorn made that.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.000
Oh...

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:21.460
What's a feeling?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.820
Huh? Uh, like when you're having fun!

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:26.380
Or...

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.720
Frustrated!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.640
Or...

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.720
Sad!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:32.390
Or...

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:38.440
Excited! And you can feel it riiiight here! You know what I'm saying?

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:39.880
I don't understand.

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:43.160
What? Tickle tickle tickle!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.180
Laugh for me-nestrone?

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:49.310
Nail Salon?

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:50.660
This ain't a word chain!

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.870
Lala, what happened then?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.830
After that, we formed a three-person team!

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:03.040
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.920
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.090
Paradise: Our goal.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.230
We swear to stand on stage as one.

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:50.370
Liberation Maiden Valkyria!

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:54.650
Cyalume Change!

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:25.310
With our three-person team, we could finally participate in a lot more events.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.530
I thought we'd ride this straight to the top.

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:31.420
But then a super strong rival appeared!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:34.360
A declaration of war!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:38.530
We will surpass you!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:43.380
We'll make you regret not teaming up with us!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.830
If you say so, Dorothy...

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:03.690
Cyalume Change!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.060
<i>Go!</i>

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:31.440
We faced off tons of times, and sometimes we won, and sometimes we lost, but having a rival

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:33.910
definitely makes you feel like you can do even better!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:37.800
And now you're our rival too. And a super strong rival!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.010
Rival?

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:43.260
Yeah. And we won't lose next time!

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:45.970
Okay.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:48.190
Huh?

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:49.650
Hm?

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:53.610
I feel like I'm forgetting something important here...

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.360
Lala, you're weird.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.110
You're the weird one!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.350
You didn't even laugh when I tickled you!

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.950
Uhh, what was it, what was it?

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.560
Aaah!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.960
I had to go back to help at home!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:08.450
Mom's gonna be so mad!

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:10.150
What's a mom?

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:17.480
The show is only a week away,
but I don't have any good ideas.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.970
Our opponent is too mysterious. I can't read her at all.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.760
Seriously-pri.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:25.000
What's all this being born out of a PriTicket business?

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.620
Why's that make her perfect-pri?

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:29.600
That is something we are investigating.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:33.150
Investigating?

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:38.040
Her birth is unprecedented in the entire history of PriPara.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.950
Why was she born?

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.820
Why was she born with the Prism Voice?

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:45.870
How does she copy abilities like she does?

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.430
What? I just found the ticket.

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.860
I don't really know anything beyond that, but...

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:55.880
I know Falulu was born to become a Divine Idol!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:20:00.990
In truth, even her manager, Unicorn doesn't know much.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:06.100
As such, we've been collating and analyzing various data on her.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:11.680
Good evening to all you idols! PriPara is about to close.

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:14.560
We're eagerly waiting for your next visit.

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:16.490
Let's go, Falulu!

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:17.860
Falulu won't go.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:22.780
What? Oh right, you live in PriPara...

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:27.990
Wait, have you never been outside PriPara?

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:29.490
Yeah.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.480
Never.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:31.180
Yeah.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.960
Well, how about you come outside with me sometime?

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:36.510
Come see my school!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:37.750
School?

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.890
I'll introduce you to my friends!

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:44.400
Unicorn said I'm not allowed to leave.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:49.840
Well, how about I start off by showing you stuff through my PriPass?

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:50.610
Huh?

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:54.330
We can talk on the PriPass while I'm at school or wherever.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:56.690
That way you can see what it's like outside, right?

00:20:57.760 --> 00:20:59.820
Through the PriPass...

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:01.400
Really?

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:02.860
Yeah!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.910
Let's make it a promise!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:08.070
Put up your little finger like this...

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:16.870
Promise!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.850
Promise...

00:23:06.580 --> 00:23:10.230
I'm showing all kinds of outside world stuff to Falulu!

00:23:10.230 --> 00:23:13.450
Lala, let's write the lyrics for our new song together!

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:17.070
We'll beat out Falulu with our original lyrics!

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:18.960
Whaaat?! Uh, Capisce!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:21.250
Uhh... Lyrics... Lyrics...

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:24.500
Huh? Unicorn seems angry.

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:29.670
Oh no! Falulu's getting in trouble for disobeying Unicorn's rules!

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:32.590
Next time: Falulu's Friends

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.140
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
